'''Sugihan Baliscans''' ({{Lang-bl|Sugiuana}} or ''Sugiuan-baliscanos'') or '''Kartasugihan Baliscans''' are people with ancestry from [[Kartasugih]] who are citizens of the [[Baliscan Confederation]]. With a population of more than 7 million in the [[2025 Baliscan census|2025 census]], Sugihan Baliscans make up approximately 4.74% of the Baliscan population.

